00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:49.490
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:01:53.060 --> 00:02:02.800
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:01:57.870 --> 00:01:59.410
I've got to protect this...

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:08.770
closed captions

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:13.420
Are you alright?

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.560
Yeah.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:15.870
I'm sorry, Kashino.

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:17.790
I pulled you down into the water too.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.190
How's the rose water?

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.250
It seems alright.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.950
The bottle is pretty hard.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.070
Are both of you alright?

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:25.960
Are you hurt?

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.600
Dry yourself quickly, or you'll catch a cold.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:33.130
Yeah.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.020
I was worried when you didn't return.

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:37.670
Here.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.680
It's an important thing, right?

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:51.600
There is no meaning to it if I can't use it.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.610
Hanabusa-kun.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.050
Tomorrow's the first round.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:02.090
To not drag everyone down, I cannot be bound by this thing anymore.

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.310
Besides, even if it's not a rose cake...

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.590
That doesn't mean you can throw it away!

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:21.430
It's important rose water that your father acquired for you!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.680
So...

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.270
You will use this to make cakes, won't you!?

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.770
To make a rose cake, to fulfill the promise with your father...

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:42.150
To have made a lady cry, it isn't like you.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.230
You really are stupid...

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:47.280
You don't have to do so much...

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:49.450
I have to because we are friends.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:52.140
You are not alone, you know?

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.150
That's right.

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:55.370
We can help you and also discuss with you.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:57.290
That's why you don't have to bottle up your feelings.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:03:59.930
Everyone...

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:01.080
The rose cake...

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.290
Let's not give up and make it.

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.800
For the sake of your father too.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.530
Yeah.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.010
Ichigo-chan, you stink of drainwater.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:17.330
It's obvious that I would stink after jumping into a dirty lake.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.180
Don't you have any delicacy?

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:22.890
I'm sorry, I just messed up...

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:26.510
I really liked these clothes.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:28.620
What should I do if I can't wash off the smell!?

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.140
You are totally soaked.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.620
Even your head has the smell.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.900
Immersed in a lake.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.340
Soaked through.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.790
Smell.

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:40.340
That's it, I understand!

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:48.380
recipe 16

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:48.380
Sweet Rose Memory

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:03.030
First pour in the syrup and rose water into the iron tray.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:07.050
Put the baked pound cake into the tray.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.780
Let every side absorb it properly.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.800
Here, try tasting it.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:18.780
Delicious.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:22.250
Moreover, this taste...

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.820
The taste of the rose really entered the cake.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:26.670
I see.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.590
Because the taste will vaporise in heat,

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:31.430
so we just need to add it after the cake has been baked.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:36.940
Using the same amount as the French sweets which were made with the syrup poured over, savarin.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:41.030
I added in rose jam when I was baking the cake.

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:44.230
Delicious.

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:45.100
Très bien.

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:46.350
Pretty good.

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:48.030
I want to eat more.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:49.810
You did it, Hanabusa.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:52.530
Yeah, the rose cake is completed.

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.620
This way, we can win tomorrow, right? Ichigo-chan.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:57.110
Amano...

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.040
What's the matter?

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.560
Umm... I have a small suggestion though.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.050
It's finally Ichigo-chan and the others' turn.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.720
I'm also getting nervous!

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:16.270
Their opponents in Team Ichimatsu looks very composed indeed.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.780
Ichigo-chan and the rest...

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:24.070
Even though the opponent has made cakes in Salon de Marie, it's not definite that we will lose.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.920
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.840
Anyway, let's put in our best effort.

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.810
The results will definitely satify us.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:30.820
Yeah.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.920
Ichigo-chan, are you alright?

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:34.680
I'm sorry.

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.340
I was in a trance.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:38.800
Thanks.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:40.280
You didn't get enough sleep, huh?

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:43.800
You had special training through the night, you didn't get to sleep.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.390
What about being sleepy! Just break through perseverance.

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:49.400
How about you, didn't you get panda eyes?

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.380
Shut up.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:53.240
Everyone please wait for us.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.140
Drink this up.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.380
That's...

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:58.340
It's coffee that I made for you.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:03.680
Then, have a drink.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:07.610
It's bitter!!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.820
Cafe's specialty. Using super bitter coffee to wake you up.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.670
Say that earlier!

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:16.440
But it's amazing, my drowsiness is gone.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:17.660
Ah, it's true.

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:20.110
I hope we will win.

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:21.350
Satsuki, do your best.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:23.000
Thank you, Cafe-kun.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.880
You all are late, barely made it on time.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.720
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.380
Team Ichigo!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.060
Do your best!

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:34.890
Andou-kun, do your best!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.610
Rumi-san. Kana-chan.

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:39.400
Thanks. I'll do my best.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:43.380
The subject for the Cake Grand Prix first round.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:45.430
Four kinds of pound cake.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:48.300
The theme is cakes that can be enjoyed by the family.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.850
The time limit is set to two hours.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:54.050
Five jury members will taste and grade the result.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:59.340
The grading will depend on these 3 points: taste, skill and theme relation.

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.580
And given a double circle, circle, triangle or cross.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:05.170
Did you manage to make your aromatic cake?

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.560
Yeah. We made an amazing one.

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.250
We will let you try it afterwards.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.080
Everybody take their respective places.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:14.760
Well then, first round.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.690
Commence cooking.

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:27.280
As expected of them.

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:28.980
Their movements are very smooth.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.820
Hey, look at those ingredients.

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:33.910
Are they gonna want that many nuts?

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.630
Other than that, look at those Japanese chestnuts.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:37.820
It's so yellowish and sparking.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:38.660
Expensive...

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:41.420
The coffee smells really great.

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:42.660
I'm sure it's the expensive type.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.290
How much does that cost!?

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:47.300
Their ingredients are really great, aren't they?

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:50.960
It seems like Ichigo's normal maccha can't win against it.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.320
Eh?

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:53.070
Peach?

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.940
Wasn't she going to use strawberries?

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:59.580
Kashino-kun is using white chocolate?

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:01.970
He was supposed to use bitter chocolate a while ago.

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:05.550
Andou-kun is using red tea.

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:07.480
Why did he give up on his unique maccha?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.960
Could they have changed the menu, just in a day?

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.440
Why?

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.250
My heart is racing!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.750
I wonder if everyone is fine!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.190
Caramel, calm down.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:20.500
But...

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:21.590
We did everything we could.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.150
Andou...

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:24.930
What's left is to believe in your partner.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:27.200
Satsuki...

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:36.650
It smells great...

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.450
As expected of Team Ichimatsu.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:42.610
They all have the ability to sell their cakes in Salon de Marie.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.300
Amikawa-san's chocolate pound cake.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:47.270
The sweet smell is simply irresistible!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:51.070
Yokoshima-san's nut pound cake.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.530
After it has been caramelized, the nuts smell really fragrant.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:56.050
Shima-san's coffee marble cake.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.720
He seems to have used roasted maccha indeed.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:01.070
I can even smell it from here.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:03.580
Ichimatsu Leader's Japanese chestnut pound cake.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:07.250
He used the highest grade chestnut to make this high class food.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.360
Ah, it seems Ichigo and the rest are done too.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.130
It looks a bit dull...

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:19.880
Ichigo made pink peach pound cake.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.130
It's rare to see Kashino using white chocolate.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:28.440
Andou who adopts tradition made a very normal red tea pound cake.

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:32.440
Hanabusa-kun who loves to make lovely desserts is...

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:37.640
Time's up.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:40.230
What an original bunch of pound cakes.

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:41.870
You are gonna embarrass yourselves in front of the judges.

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:44.550
It seems we've won.

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:04.130
We will eat the cake now.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:07.140
Please place the four kinds of cakes on a plate.

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.800
It's really gorgeous.

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:15.440
Please base it on an image of a family eating the cakes together on an Autumn night.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.790
Please eat.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:20.170
Well then, itadakimasu.

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:31.070
This nutty taste that explodes in the mouth,

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:34.980
it's crunchy and the taste spreads out well.

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:38.500
This chocolate is rich yet it's not overly sweet.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:39.840
It's soft in the mouth.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:45.530
The taste and the bitterness is just like coffee, really aromatic.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.350
It really has an adult-like taste.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.810
I can cut it so smoothly.

00:11:57.450 --> 00:11:59.890
All of them are very pure and nice to eat.

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:04.850
It's just like the Autumn night when adults are having teatime.

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:13.990
Ichigo and the others are up next, right?

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:18.900
Please wait for a moment.

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:23.210
We will bring everyone to the rose garden now.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:34.890
It's a rose.

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:36.430
It's a large-flowered rose.

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:39.900
He drew out a rose presentation, right?

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.900
This is commendable.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.480
We based it on an image of a family playing in the park.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:49.810
Please fill yourselves with joy of the taste and smell of the roses.

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:52.060
A rose, huh?

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:54.660
It's also a really difficult skill.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:06.490
This is the natural taste of the rose itself.

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:10.820
It has the taste of rose jam and butter baked together, doesn't it?

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:12.780
It makes me feel painful.

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:17.110
It's the first time I've eaten this kind of cake.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:22.770
The peach pound cake too, it's cute and juicy.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:26.580
The white chocolate and the nuts gives the feelings of kindness.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:31.620
The taste of red tea causes all of the other tastes to combined into one, doesn't it?

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:36.650
Team Ichigo got high scores too.

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.210
They have to battle it out on the tastes.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.980
We won.

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:42.590
If it's the taste, it's impossible for us to lose.

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:45.490
It's alright.

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:47.220
We did what we could.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:50.810
Besides, I'm sure your father will pray for us.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:51.980
Ichigo-chan...

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:54.210
We can't win with just prayers, can we?

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.260
What are you saying, Kashino!?

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:56.350
That attitude is too much.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:01.610
Didn't you say we put in all our effort, so results will definitely follow?

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.110
Even that's the case!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.680
Geez... Kashino is really dense.

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:08.030
Alright...

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:10.250
Well then, everyone.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:12.530
Will that be alright?

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.150
They did it!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:29.990
We did it!

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:30.710
We won!

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:33.460
Hanabusa, the rose cake tops off.

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:34.780
Yeah.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.190
What's with you all!?

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:39.930
Sensei, why did we lose!?

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:41.250
We just can't accept it!

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:44.900
The cakes we made that are sold in Salon de Marie losing out on the taste-

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.070
Please calm down.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.630
Please explain!

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.530
Team Ichimatsu.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:56.690
It's true that every one of your cakes are amazing and we recognise that.

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:58.220
Then why!?

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:00.540
But when the four are together,

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:05.170
all of them are too rich, and the tastes conflict with each other.

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:12.390
Have you all thought about the balance of the tastes of the four kinds of cakes eaten together?

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.660
T-That's...

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:18.760
On the other hand, Team Ichigo,

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:24.540
based it on the theme of rose cake, and every cake the taste, smell, and colour are in tune.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:27.640
At the same time, each cake sets off the taste of the other cakes.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:30.500
Yet the rose smell remains.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:33.910
The mood is as if we are really having a picnic in a rose garden.

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.410
You all try eating it.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.610
They won.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.830
They did it! Team Ichigo emerged victorious in the first round.

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:14.910
Congratulations!

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:20.410
Thank goodness. Hanabusa-kun's father, we won.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.230
Through using a rose cake.

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:28.340
Thank goodness. Thank goodness.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:31.870
Rose cake. It's the fruit of everyone's efforts, isn't it?

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:34.310
It isn't time to be moved to tears.

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:36.380
It's time for us to take the stage.

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:37.080
Yeah.

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:41.190
Magical macaron.

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:45.940
Sweets Romance Card, come out!

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:57.320
Everyone, come over here.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:16:59.870
We are having teatime to thank everyone!

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:01.780
Yes!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.640
We somehow broke through the first round.

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:09.470
Yeah.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:14.220
When Amano-san said "let's change the cakes" yesterday, I was at my wits end.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:17.220
Changing all the cakes other than the rose cake?

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:21.060
Yeah, because the taste and smell were conflicting with each other.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.570
It's true.

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:26.660
This time the main focus is the rose cake.

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:28.240
So to set off the rose cake,

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.570
I think it's better for use to change a bit on the other tastes.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:34.570
We're going to change them in a night, huh?

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.600
We still have a night.

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:38.270
We can do it if we want to.

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:40.050
We'll help out too.

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.170
If we combine our powers, I'm sure we'll be able do it.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:45.970
Let everyone help complete the rose cake.

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:46.750
You're right.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.120
Everyone...

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.310
Let's do our best!

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.760
Yeah!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:58.380
Amano-san is the leader who leads in image, isn't it?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.880
Yeah.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.170
Itadakimasu.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:11.690
Delicious~

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:15.780
Ichigo-chan looks really happy when she eats cakes.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:18.290
Because the cake is really delicious.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:22.120
Besides, this rose cake is not just tasty.

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:24.700
Close your eyes and eat it.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.140
Eyes?

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:26.930
Yes.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.360
Papa!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:41.800
It's dessert!

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.520
Satsuki?

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.550
Are you alright?

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:52.230
Did you get hurt?

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:56.440
I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:59.740
Satsuki, we just have to grow the roses again.

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:04.120
You can make the cookies together with Mama again.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.790
So, don't cry.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.870
You won't hate me?

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:14.720
Of course not.

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:18.620
No matter what, Papa will always love Satsuki.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.380
Always.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:26.390
That's why, come on, smile.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:32.400
Me too. I'll always love Papa!

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:41.070
It's true.

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.410
The memory that time was amazing.

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:54.450
When you eat this, you will remember your childhood memories.

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:58.460
It's nostalgic and a little painful.

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:00.960
It's because of the fragrance of the rose, right?

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:03.800
The fragrance of the rose is said to be able to jog one's memories.

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:07.210
We have to properly thank Hanabusa-kun's Papa, right?

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:12.020
We were able to make such a wonderful cake thanks to this rose water.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.980
It's also thanks to you.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:27.310
W-W-W-What are you doing, Hanabusa!?

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:30.830
You bastard! Having a relationship with group members is forbidden!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.460
What are you saying? Right, Ichigo-chan?

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:39.590
That's right. A peck on the cheek is just a greeting for Hanabusa-kun.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.580
Right, Hanabusa-kun?

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:42.670
I guess you're right...

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:46.680
What sort of person am I?

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:50.270
It's really delicious!

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:51.890
Ichigo, you have eaten too much!

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.850
You finished the other's share, didn't you?

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:57.060
Amano-san, it's great that she's a natural airhead, isn't it?

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:58.940
What do you mean?

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:04.280
Nothing. When Amano-san fell into the lake, you were dead worried, right?

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.990
It's her fault that jumping right in.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.530
Besides, I didn't ask her to jump in.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:14.370
Henri-sensei, we have broken through Cake Grand Prix's first round.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:18.720
I want sensei to try the rose cake too.

